ts{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-05-04T18:36:39Z","updated_at":"2018-05-04T18:36:39Z","body":"With PSQL 9.6.8 there is a different intermittent failure:\r\n```\r\n21:36 $ docker exec -it yb-tserver-n3 /home/yugabyte/bin/psql --host yb-tserver-n3 --port 5433 -c \"SELECT * FROM sample.stock_market;\"\r\nDatabase 'root' does not exist\r\nmessage type 0x5a arrived from server while idle\r\nsh: relocation error: /home/yugabyte/bin/../lib/linuxbrew/libc.so.6: symbol _dl_find_dso_for_object, version GLIBC_PRIVATE not defined in file ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 with link time reference\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/386695241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/386695286","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/269#issuecomment-386695286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/269","id":386695286,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4NjY5NTI4Ng==","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-05-04T18:36:48Z","updated_at":"2018-05-04T18:36:48Z","body":"I’ve found the root cause of issue with `psql` under docker:\r\n1) All 3rd party and YB binaries are dynamically linked with libs from linuxbrew.\r\n2) On cluster node these binaries are wrapped with scripts which set `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` before unwrapped binary execution.\r\n3) `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` affects not only where to search libs for the binary, but also for any process which is executed from that binary.\r\n4) System binaries under docker centos are dynamically linked with system libs (particularly libc) which are not compatible with ones which we have in linuxbrew.\r\n5) PSQL tool *sometimes* executes `more` via shell using `popen` system call in order to paginate output.\r\n6) As a consequence `sh` which is built using std libs which are not compatible with std libs from linuxbrew fails and its output is displayed in a `psql` output.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/386695286/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/386695588","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/269#issuecomment-386695588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/269","id":386695588,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4NjY5NTU4OA==","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-05-04T18:37:57Z","updated_at":"2018-05-04T18:37:57Z","body":"Found a way to set libraries only for binary we want to run and avoid doing it for child processes:\r\n```\r\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\r\n${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/ld.so --library-path ${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/system:${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/yb:${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/yb-thirdparty:${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/linuxbrew ${BASH_SOURCE%/*}/../lib/unwrapped/psql \"$@\"\r\n```\r\nIf we use `ld.so` linker with `--library-path` option to run the binary - this will affect only this binary, but not its child processes (as happens when using `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` env var)\r\n\r\nAlso, we can use http://bitwagon.com/rtldi/rtldi.html ELF program interpreter and avoid wrapper scripts at all, but we will have to put all libs in one directory without nested dirs. Or another option is to have simple interpreter based on rtldi which allows multiple libs directories.\r\n\r\nProbably using rtldi and put all libs in one directory is the best option - it eliminates wrapper scripts and we can check for lib names conflicts during packaging the release, if there is more than one lib with the same name - most probably we have an issue with the build.\r\n\r\nBut the first step could be to just update wrapper scripts to use `ld.so --library-path` instead of `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/386695588/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1610881246,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQxNjEwODgxMjQ2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/1610881246","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","o